**First aid** is the immediate help given to an injured or suddenly sick person before medical help arrives. It is necessary (any four):

1. to **save the life** of the victim;
2. to **prevent the condition from getting worse**;
3. to **relieve pain** and calm the victim;
4. to **prevent infection** of wounds;
5. to **help recovery** and reduce the time spent in hospital.
